'''Lakeshire''' is a human township that sits on the banks of [[Lake Everstill]] in the [[Redridge Mountains]]. The town is led by [[Magistrate Solomon]] and the [[Court of Lakeshire]], while [[Marshal Marris]] and the [[Stormwind Guard]] are in charge of the security. The town contains a town hall, an inn, [[Verner Osgood]]'s stables,<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|20|A Baying of Gnolls}}</ref> and Chef Breanna's restaurant-house. Recently, the Everstill Bridge was destroyed by the marauding [[Blackrock clan|Blackrock]] [[orc]]s.

Like [[Westfall]] and [[Duskwood]], Redridge Mountains is also under the theoretical protection of the [[Stormwind (kingdom)|Stormwind]] army and, like them, has been left mostly to its own devices. However, there is a small guard platoon situated there and the area is still relatively quiet. The nearby [[Stonewatch Keep]] has been overrun by orcs that sometimes stage small raids into the city. 

