==Contains==
{{Book|content=
For $N:

I'm Mayten Boomrifle, the local big game hunter. Believe it or not, I was going to be on the hunt in [[Stranglethorn Vale]] with [[Hemmet Nesingwary]] himself. Unfortunately, my debts to the Venture Co. dragged me out here to this dirt hole.

There's not much to shoot out here but buzzards or crows, but that doesn't mean you shouldn't try to be a proper marksman. I saw the way you were lining up your shots earlier, and I think you could benefit from training with me. For just a few coins, you could learn to be a real sharpshooter.
